    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851590/extras/deb195d1f39b8af8d7258a8176234209.avif?t=1631538454\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>Cosplay Crisis Convention</strong> is a visual novel where all your dreams come true. Jacob Kirby was just a regular geek when he found himself dragged into a massive intergalactic conflict\u2026between three beautiful girls. Which side will he choose? It\u2019s up to you!<br><br>Protect the Earth or leave the home planet to sail the universe? Find your soulmate or teach alien girls how to love? Attend a panel discussion with the most famous stars in the industry or watch a mysterious performance in the hall? You can even try to save Dr. Quinzel from jumping into acid! The choice is yours. But remember, every decision has its price.</i><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851590/extras/15f49f81b0af405d30c81c6b33733329.avif?t=1631538454\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851590/extras/63a54189b7770b5cdbeb2ce9bd6520ce.avif?t=1631538454\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851590/extras/8e842ec759c535ec5612f6780abfe591.avif?t=1631538454\" /></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple Visual Novel user experience<br></li><li>Choices to help you select your favorite girl and to solve disputes<br></li><li>Choose a schedule for each day of the Con<br></li><li>About 100,000 words of text.<br></li><li>4 or more endings.<br></li><li>More than 5 backgrounds and 20 CG are in the demo and more are planned!<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Steam Trading Cards (when we are given access)</li></ul>",
